'''Gilgamesh''' (ギルガメッシュ) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gilgamesh
|image = E 372.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 4,000¢ - 15,800¢
}}

==Enemy==
Arguably the strongest enemy in the collab, Gilgamesh is a very tanky [[Long Distance]] attacker that rapidly delivers closely-spaced multi-hits from extreme range. However, he has a massive 600 blindspot and his standing range is well within it, so most units can easily infiltrate it when given the chance.

==Strategy==
Outranging Gilgamesh or stalling him is nigh-impossible, and the best option to fight him is to have units that can either slip past his attacks or tank enough damage to enter his blindspot and eliminate whatever that's covering him.

